Description:It is your first main phase. You control Hill Giant (3/3) and Ornithopter (0/2, summoning sick), and have Dromoka's Gift (bolster 4) and Shock in hand with {R}{G}{G}{G}{G}{G} floating. The opponent is at 7 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-bolster-least-toughness | Bolster puts its counters on the creature you control with the least toughness, chosen as it resolves (CR 701.39a): Shock your own Ornithopter first, then bolster 4 goes on the Giant for a 7/7; otherwise the counters go on the Ornithopter and Shock to the face plus the Giant make 5
